        'markdown' => 'Islamabad, September 18, 2024 — All Pakistan Marble Industries Association (APMIA) successfully conducted its Annual General Meeting (AGM) and Oath-Taking Ceremony for the new office bearers today. The event was honored by the presence of Chief Guest Mr. Rana Mashhood Ahmad Khan, Chairman of the PM Youth Program, and Mr. Atif Ikram Sheikh, President of the Federation of Pakistan Chambers of Commerce and Industry (FPCCI).  
The event was further attended by distinguished former Chairmen, including:  
  
– Mr. Asghar Khan Utmankhel  
– Mr. Muhammad Shakeel Munir  
– Mr. Farukh Majeed  
– Mr. Ilyas Muhammad  
– Mr. Gulzar Ahmad  
– Mr. Shabir Ahmad Baloch  
  
