The guests and seniors highly appreciate the remarkable efforts & achievements of the outgoing Chairman Asgher Khan Utmankhel & his team.  
The new office bearers were sworn in:  
  
– Chairman: Mr. Muhammad Bilal Khan Mohmand  
– Senior Vice Chairman: Mr. Mian Irfan Zafar  
– Vice Chairman (South): Mr. Rahat Shah  
– Vice Chairman: Mr. Shah Khalid Safi

Mr. Muhammad Bilal Khan Mohmand, the incoming Chairman, committed to continue the legacy of the outgoing team by focusing on core targets:  
  
1. Mining Mechanization  
2. Better Transportation  
3. Value Addition  
4. Boosting Exports  
  
The AGM also featured discussions on future initiatives and strategic plans to address the mining industry challenges. The event concluded with a networking session, providing an opportunity for attendees to engage with industry peers and explore collaborative opportunities.
